              "id": "blk-d2c1dda4",
              "type": "source_block",
              "lines": [
                "Naboti muyezesreeli alilima shamba lake (pembeni ya Ahabawa samaria ah)2x",
                "Bwana kamwandea kweli kamwambia Naboti unipe shamba lako mimi ni jifanyie maboga (ewe Nabo",
                "ti) 2x kujibia kwa Naboti sita kupa uriti yoyoyo wa baba zangu."
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-8bee7bda",
              "type": "comment",
              "lines": [
                "- Ewe mufalme\tsitakupa uriti yoyoyo wa baba zangu",
                "- Ewe mutu wa mwili"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-fb5ff6ac",
              "type": "refrain",
              "lines": [
                "Eh kujizuiza, kweli kujizuiza, kujizuiza ni kuzuri wajoli mbele ya mufalme tazama Naboti muyesreeli kajizuiza kwa kuzisha shamba lake¨2x Mufalme kaja na asira kali mbele",
                "ya mukewe kwanini moyo wako unau zuni aule chakula (moyo hufurahi ule chakula eh mufalme shamba la Naboti litakuwa lako eh mufalme)2x"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-5da10d48",
              "type": "source_block",
              "lines": [
                "Yezebeli kaandika baruwa kwa muhuri wa mufalme",
                "(mutie watu wa wili mbele ya muyezesreeli wamusingizie mambo)2x",
                "huyu Naboti alitukana mungu na mufalme na vivio vika timia, navio vikatimia Naboti akafa kwa mawe, Naboti akafa."
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-591ba8a9",
              "type": "comment",
              "lines": [
                "- Eyo Naboti\takafa kwa mawe Naboti akafa",
                "- Mutu wa imani chache",
                "- Mutu wa uzima wake"
              ]
            }
          ],
