              "type": "verse",
              "number": "1",
              "lines": [
                "Wakamutupa Danieli pangoni mwa simba kwani alikuwa mufanya kazi wa mungu wa uzima kila siku siku zote mara tatu , chumba chake cha juu madirisha wangalia mu yerusalem."
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-d6a33fb8",
              "type": "refrain",
              "lines": [
                "Mwalimu Danieli , Danieli wewe pangoni mwa simba \"2x Basi tazama Danieli simba akumula yoyo kwa jina la mufalme \"2x Tazama kerubi, kerubi wa mufalme wa bwana kafungae simba."
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-0920698e",
              "type": "verse",
              "number": "2",
              "lines": [
                "Ili neno la mfalme dario : Mungu wa Danieli ahimidive \"2x akuna mungu mwingine inchini mwangu."
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-217612f2",
              "type": "verse",
              "number": "3",
              "lines": [
                "\"Wakija na jambo la duniani kwa wewe mujoli \"2x basi wewe ujuwe neno la mungu unalo litakuokowa pangoni mwa simba , litakuokoa mu mambo ya dunia."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
